# The high profile with every impact contact compliant (PhysX PX_DESTRUCTION_IMPACT_COMPLIANT;
# docs/destruction/IMPACT_STEP_PLAN.md "compliant impact contacts"): routing by the compliant
# row's peak force against capacity and crush onset, crush in the window's rows paid by the
# striker, and the corrected pass taking the window's verdict and end velocities (the decided
# pairs dropped). Needs an SDK with it (PhysX feat/impact-compliant): HIGH_PHYSX_ROOT.
export PX_DESTRUCTION_IMPACT_COMPLIANT=1
